 #### New Features
 
 * Add `add_bond_type_one_hot` edge feature for molecules. Fixes [#430](https://github.com/a-r-j/graphein/issues/430)
+* The `graphein` CLI could only build graphs from the `ProteinGraphConfig()` defaults (peptide bonds only) or a YAML config the user wrote themselves, because the package shipped no configs. Built-in configs can now be passed to `-c` by name and listed with `--list-configs`; any other value is read as a path to a YAML file, as before. Includes `ca_distance_10`, a C-alpha graph with peptide bonds and 10 Å distance-threshold edges (`graphein -c ca_distance_10 -p path/to/pdbs -o path/to/output`). Running without `-c` is unchanged. Fixes [#123](https://github.com/a-r-j/graphein/issues/123) [#521](https://github.com/a-r-j/graphein/pull/521)
 
 #### Breaking Changes
 
